owing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-07T21:24:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T21:24:29Z","body":"I think guidance on when to use Basis Universal or VRAM Compressed is still missing. Should Basis Universal only be used when targeting web?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4644143708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649858088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120061#issuecomment-4649858088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120061","id":4649858088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFSc0KA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T14:12:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T14:12:25Z","body":"> I think guidance on when to use Basis Universal or VRAM Compressed is still missing. Should Basis Universal only be used when targeting web?\r\n\r\nBasis Universal makes more sense to use when you want the smallest export sizes, at the cost of quality. This is generally the case for the web platform, but mobile platforms can also benefit from targeting the smallest export size possible.\r\n\r\nFor desktop platforms, installation size is less critical and faster loading times are generally favored.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649858088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649977679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120061#issuecomment-4649977679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120061","id":4649977679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFSkHTw","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T14:23:59Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T14:23:59Z","body":"> Basis Universal makes more sense to use when you want the smallest export sizes, at the cost of quality. This is generally the case for the web platform, but mobile platforms can also benefit from targeting the smallest export size possible.\n> \n> For desktop platforms, installation size is less critical and faster loading times are generally favored.\n\nOK. But, the documentation (low size on disk -> lowest size on disk) and what you've said here makes it seem like VRAM Compressed is just a bit less efficient. If VRAM Compressed potentially has to include multiple formats, does that not mean it would be *very high size on disk* (significantly higher than all other options)?\n\nAlso, why have you stated \"at the cost of quality\"? Is Basis Universal lower quality than VRAM Compressed?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4649977679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4650035040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120061#issuecomment-4650035040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120061","id":4650035040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFSnnYA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T14:29:48Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T14:29:56Z","body":"> Also, why have you stated \"at the cost of quality\"? Is Basis Universal lower quality than VRAM Compressed?\r\n\r\nYes, due to the transcoding process involved (the Basis Universal intermediate format is lossy). There's also an import option to enable further quality loss for even smaller file sizes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4650035040/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]